  unitName: Feral Katana Toutetsu
  unitId: 30616
  unitNumber: 986
  description: A dual-blade samurai from another world. Though many scholars disagree
    with the reason why Toutetsu was after the demon blade, the most influential
    of them believe it was because he had been cursed by it. As he came to be feared
    by the demons of Ishgria while continuously slaying them in large numbers, one
    day he felt that his life was suddenly at an end. The demon blade had been destroyed
    in another world. Once he knew, it is said he smiled wholeheartedly while proclaiming
    that the meaning of his life could only be found in death.
  summonDesc: A person's value is in their death. That's why immortality is worthless.
    It disturbs one's growth.
  fusionDesc: The strength to face a painful death became my wish after I was cursed.
    My soul is far from free.
  evoDesc: I can feel my soul elevating... I won't have an easy death, but I will
    harness this power!
  element: 3
  rarity: 6
